> Conclusion

Both map methods retain actual coarse features,raw amplitudes and fixed targets. Independent formula/higher-derivative checks and real-tail finite differences validate the stated computation;normalization and control similarities limit what the maps establish about explanation quality or object localization.

> References

- [Selvaraju et al.(2017),Grad-CAM](https://arxiv.org/abs/1610.02391).
- [Chattopadhyay et al.(2018),Grad-CAM++:Improved Visual Explanations for Deep Convolutional Networks](https://arxiv.org/abs/1710.11063).
